// deathtips_data.acs — built-in death tip data + registration (fragment).
// Included by deathtips.acs AFTER the registry API; declares no library.
//
// Demoneye quotes
// Idea stolen from LMSGames who stole it from Internal Conflict
//
// The tip tables below are the former hardcoded contents of deathtips.acs,
// transcribed verbatim (strings, wrap widths and pool membership must stay
// byte-identical: per-tip wrap widths drive SetHudWrapWidth and the bylines
// are part of the death HUD).  UH_RegisterBuiltinTips() copies them into the
// runtime registry once per map on the server (plain OPEN) and once per map
// on every client (OPEN CLIENTSIDE twin); UH_RegisterTip dedupes by
// (pool, text, author) so the twin runs are idempotent.

